sequenceDiagram
  participant Service as Ingestion service
  participant Detector as Detection module
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Service->>DB: Read active rule versions and event-time history
  Service->>Detector: Frozen features and versions
  Detector->>Detector: Evaluate rule predicates, aggregate anomaly points
  Detector-->>Service: Factors, score, category and anomaly
  Service->>DB: Insert immutable assessment by transaction and basis
  opt Assessment reaches HIGH
    Service->>DB: Find and lock eligible customer case
    alt No eligible case
      Service->>DB: Open case with priority and SLA
    else Active case
      Service->>DB: Refresh priority and revision
    end
    Service->>DB: Insert alert linked to assessment and case
  end
  Service->>DB: Append audit and commit
